WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.250
This blade has a dark past.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:09.550
It has shed much innocent blood.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.200
You're a fool for traveling alone,
so completely unprepared.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.550
You're lucky your blood's still flowing.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.050
Thank you.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.750
So...

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:27.550
What brings you to
the land of the gatekeepers?

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.250
I'm searching for someone.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:35.950
Someone very dear?
A kindred spirit?

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:38.750
A dragon.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.500
A dangerous quest for a lone hunter.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:49.620
I've been alone for
as long as I can remember.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.250
We're almost done. Shhh...

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.250
Hey, sit still.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:06.000
Good night, Scales.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:27.600
Get him, Scales! Come on!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Scales?

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:21.250
Yeah! Come on!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.750
Scales!

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.250
I have failed.

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:50.250
You've only failed to see...

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.250
These are dragon lands, Sintel.

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:57.750
You are closer than you know.

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:33.250
Scales!

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:37.750
Scales?

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:43.550
Scales...
